00:01:49.721 --> 00:01:51.540
but no, I was a huge "Ms.
Marvel" fan in high school.

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:52.500
I read all the comics.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.410
I was a Marvel nerd, my
entire life surrounded Marvel.

00:01:55.410 --> 00:01:57.780
And now people actually have
to listen when I talk about it.

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:59.051
Cuz I like work for it.

00:01:59.051 --> 00:01:59.970
- Oh my God, you get paid for it now.

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:01.107
- It's crazy.

00:02:01.107 --> 00:02:01.940
- That's amazing.

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:02.773
- But yeah.

00:02:02.773 --> 00:02:03.606
