00:04:50.451 --> 00:04:52.180
- It's so weird, So wonderful.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:53.180
- I know

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:54.013
- It's amazing.

00:04:54.013 --> 00:04:55.163
You're like a dream come true, young lady,

00:04:55.163 --> 00:04:56.695
